37,2,1,talk,George,,"- **George**: The staffing logs are grim. Front-of-house posts remain empty, yet our technicians still have hours to spare.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, that’s a stark contrast. My delivery data shows inspection-driven projects finish on time, while comfort-based ones slip a year.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Mizuki"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Mizuki: @George, that’s a stark contrast. My delivery data shows inspection-driven projects finish on time, while comfort-based ones slip a year.""}]}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mizuki, that aligns with my findings. Tender prices for mechanical plant have risen twenty percent, while our renewal reserves remain empty.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Benjamin"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Benjamin**: @Mizuki, that aligns with my findings. Tender prices for mechanical plant have risen twenty percent, while our renewal reserves remain empty.""}]}"
